## Verification & Expected Outcome
Run `verify.sh` or inspect PVC:
```bash
kubectl get pvc data-pvc
```
Expected Output:
```
NAME       STATUS   VOLUME             CAPACITY   ACCESS MODES   STORAGECLASS   AGE
data-pvc   Bound    local-pv-storage   5Gi        RWO            standard       5m
```
The PVC must show `STATUS: Bound` and the `db-app` pod must reach `1/1 Running`.
